<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Nutrition Month 2026 | Eat Right, Stay Bright!</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --green: #2E8B57;
            --light-green: #90EE90;
            --orange: #FF8C00;
            --red: #FF4500;
            --yellow: #FFD700;
            --blue: #4682B4;
            --white: #FFFFFF;
            --text-dark: #333333;
            --shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #F0FFF0, #FFFFF0);
            color: var(--text-dark);
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        /* Header & Banner */
        header {
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(46,139,87,0.8), rgba(255,140,0,0.7)), 
                        url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542838132-92c53300491e?w=1200') center/cover no-repeat;
            color: var(--white);
            text-align: center;
            padding: 80px 20px;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        header h1 {
            font-size: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
            animation: fadeInDown 1s ease;
        }

        header p {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            animation: fadeInUp 1s ease 0.3s both;
        }

        /* Floating Fruit Decorations */
        .floating-item {
            position: absolute;
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            opacity: 0.25;
            animation: float 8s infinite ease-in-out;
        }
        .f1 { top: 15%; left: 5%; animation-delay: 0s; }
        .f2 { top: 25%; right: 8%; animation-delay: 1.5s; }
        .f3 { bottom: 10%; left: 12%; animation-delay: 3s; }
        .f4 { bottom: 20%; right: 5%; animation-delay: 4.5s; }

        /* Navigation */
        nav {
            background: var(--white);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 999;
            padding: 12px;
        }
        nav ul {
            list-style: none;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 15px;
        }
        nav a {
            color: var(--green);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            padding: 8px 15px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        nav a:hover {
            background: var(--light-green);
            color: var(--white);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        /* Sections */
        section {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 50px auto;
            padding: 0 25px;
        }
        .section-title {
            text-align: center;
            color: var(--green);
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            margin-bottom: 35px;
            padding-bottom: 12px;
            border-bottom: 3px solid var(--orange);
            display: inline-block;
            margin-left: auto;
            margin-right: auto;
        }
        .title-wrap { text-align: center; }

        /* Fruit & Veggie Gallery */
        .food-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
            gap: 25px;
        }
        .food-card {
            background: var(--white);
            border-radius: 18px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
            transition: transform 0.4s ease, box-shadow 0.4s ease;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .food-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-10px) rotate(1deg);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
        }
        .food-card img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 200px;
            object-fit: cover;
            transition: transform 0.5s ease;
        }
        .food-card:hover img { transform: scale(1.1); }
        .food-card h3 {
            color: var(--red);
            padding: 15px 15px 5px;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
        }
        .food-card p { padding: 0 15px 15px; font-size: 0.95rem; color: #555; }

        /* Nutrition Facts */
        .facts-container {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 25px;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        .fact-box {
            flex: 1 1 300px;
            background: var(--white);
            border-left: 6px solid var(--orange);
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
            transition: 0.3s;
        }
        .fact-box:hover { border-left-color: var(--green); padding-left: 30px; }
        .fact-box h3 { color: var(--green); margin-bottom: 12px; }

        /* Tips Section */
        .tips-list {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
            border-radius: 15px;
            padding: 30px;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
        }
        .tips-list li {
            margin: 15px 0;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            list-style: none;
            padding-left: 35px;
            position: relative;
            transition: 0.2s;
        }
        .tips-list li:hover { padding-left: 45px; color: var(--green); }
        .tips-list li::before {
            content: "🥗";
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            top: 0;
        }

        /* Banner Image */
        .big-banner {
            width: 100%;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
            margin: 30px 0;
            transition: transform 0.5s ease;
        }
        .big-banner:hover { transform: scale(1.02); }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            background: var(--green);
            color: var(--white);
            text-align: center;
            padding: 35px 20px;
            margin-top: 60px;
        }
        footer p { margin: 8px 0; }

        /* Animations */
        @keyframes fadeInDown {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-40px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }
        @keyframes fadeInUp {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(40px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }
        @keyframes float {
            0%,100% { transform: translateY(0) rotate(-5deg); }
            50% { transform: translateY(-25px) rotate(5deg); }
        }

        /* Responsive */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            header h1 { font-size: 2rem; }
            header p { font-size: 1.1rem; }
            .section-title { font-size: 1.7rem; }
            nav ul { gap: 8px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- Header -->
<header>
    <div class="floating-item f1">🍎</div>
    <div class="floating-item f2">🥦</div>
    <div class="floating-item f3">🍌</div>
    <div class="floating-item f4">🥕</div>

    <h1>🥗 NUTRITION MONTH 2026 🥗</h1>
    <p>"Healthy Diet, Healthy Life: Eat More Fruits & Vegetables Every Day!"</p>
</header>

<!-- Navigation -->
<nav>
    <ul>
        <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
        <li><a href="#foods">Fruits & Veggies</a></li>
        <li><a href="#facts">Nutrition Facts</a></li>
        <li><a href="#tips">Healthy Tips</a></li>
    </ul>
</nav>

<!-- About Section -->
<section id="about">
    <div class="title-wrap"><h2 class="section-title">Why Nutrition Matters?</h2></div>
    <p style="text-align:center; font-size:1.1rem; max-width:900px; margin:0 auto;">
        Good nutrition keeps our body strong, mind sharp, and protects us from sickness. 
        Eating colorful fruits and vegetables gives us vitamins, minerals, and fiber we need to grow and stay healthy!
    </p>
    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1490645935967-10de6ba17062?w=1200" alt="Healthy Food Spread" class="big-banner">
</section>

<!-- Fruits & Vegetables Gallery -->
<section id="foods">
    <div class="title-wrap"><h2 class="section-title">🍎 Fresh Fruits & Vegetables 🥦</h2></div>
    <div class="food-grid">
        <div class="food-card">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1568702846914-96b305d05f21?w=600" alt="Apple">
            <h3>Apple</h3>
            <p>Rich in fiber and Vitamin C. Helps heart health and digestion.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="food-card">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1598170845058-32b9d6a5da37?w=600" alt="Banana">
            <h3>Banana</h3>
            <p>Great source of potassium and energy. Perfect for active people!</p>
        </div>
        <div class="food-card">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1459411552884-841db9b3cc2a?w=600" alt="Orange">
            <h3>Orange</h3>
            <p>Packed with Vitamin C to boost your immune system.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="food-card">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1459411552884-841db9b3cc2a?w=600" alt="Broccoli">
            <h3>Broccoli</h3>
            <p>Loaded with Vitamin K, iron, and calcium for strong bones.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="food-card">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1598170845058-32b9d6a5da37?w=600" alt="Carrot">
            <h3>Carrot</h3>
            <p>Beta-carotene keeps your eyesight clear and healthy.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="food-card">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1540420773420-3366772f4999?w=600" alt="Strawberry">
            <h3>Strawberry</h3>
            <p>Antioxidant-rich and low in sugar. Great for skin health!</p>
        </div>
        <div class="food-card">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1587735243615-c039b216b1d5?w=600" alt="Spinach">
            <h3>Spinach</h3>
            <p>Full of iron and folate. Good for blood and energy.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="food-card">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519996529931-283f406e123b?w=600" alt="Watermelon">
            <h3>Watermelon</h3>
            <p>High water content keeps you hydrated and cool!</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Nutrition Facts -->
<section id="facts">
    <div class="title-wrap"><h2 class="section-title">📊 Important Nutrition Facts</h2></div>
    <div class="facts-container">
        <div class="fact-box">
            <h3>✅ Eat 5 Servings Daily</h3>
            <p>Health experts recommend at least 3 servings of vegetables and 2 servings of fruits every day.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="fact-box">
            <h3>✅ Natural is Best</h3>
            <p>Fresh or lightly cooked foods keep more vitamins than processed or fried ones.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="fact-box">
            <h3>✅ Colorful Plate</h3>
            <p>Different colors mean different nutrients! Eat red, green, orange, and purple foods.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="fact-box">
            <h3>✅ Less Sugar & Salt</h3>
            <p>Too much sugar and salt can harm your body. Use fruits for natural sweetness instead!</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Healthy Tips -->
<section id="tips">
    <div class="title-wrap"><h2 class="section-title">💡 Easy Healthy Eating Tips</h2></div>
    <ul class="tips-list">
        <li>Start your day with fruit instead of sugary snacks.</li>
        <li>Add vegetables to rice, noodles, soups, or sandwiches.</li>
        <li>Drink water instead of soda or sweet drinks.</li>
        <li>Try one new fruit or vegetable every week.</li>
        <li>Eat slowly and chew well to help digestion.</li>
        <li>Share healthy meals with your family and friends!</li>
    </ul>
</section>

<!-- Footer -->
<footer>
    <h3>🌿 Eat Right, Shine Bright! 🌿</h3>
    <p>Happy Nutrition Month 2026 | Made for School Project</p>
    <p>Images from Unsplash • Free for Educational Use</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>

